SUMMARY:Deadline: Overseas Press Club Foundation Scholar Awards 2027 (inter
 national journalism\, USD 3\,000 scholarships and USD 4\,000 bureau fellow
 ships)
DESCRIPTION:The OPC Foundation's Scholar Awards support students who want t
 o become international correspondents. WHO: college juniors\, seniors and 
 graduate students enrolled full-time at the deadline at a US college or un
 iversity\, or US citizens studying at a university abroad\; any nationalit
 y.\n\nOrganisation: Overseas Press Club Foundation\nLocation: USA. For stu
 dents at US colleges and universities\, or US citizens studying at a unive
 rsity abroad\; any nationality.\nAward: About 18 awards a year: USD 3\,000
  scholarships for independent work or USD 4\,000 fellowships funding time 
 in an overseas news bureau (such as AP\, Reuters or Bloomberg). Four are r
 eserved for international business or economic coverage. No application fe
 e.\nDuration: 2027 award year\; fellowships place winners in an overseas b
 ureau\n\nMore: https://www.overseaspressclubfoundation.org/scholar-awards-
 program?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.overseaspressclubfoundation.org/scholar-awards-program?utm_
 source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:USA. For students at US colleges and universities\, or US citizens
  studying at a university abroad\; any nationality.
END:VEVENT
