DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270108
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270109
SUMMARY:Deadline: American Documentary Film Fund 2027: AmDocs pitch competi
 tion for US documentary projects (up to USD 50\,000)
DESCRIPTION:The American Documentary Film Fund is the pitch competition of 
 AmDocs\, the American Documentary and Animation Film Festival in Palm Spri
 ngs. A select group of documentary projects is invited to pitch to an indu
 stry panel during the festival\, and the fund distributes upwards of USD 5
 0\,000 a year to the winning project or projects. WHO: documentary filmmak
 ers who are US citizens or legal residents.\n\nOrganisation: American Docu
 mentary and Animation Film Festival (AmDocs)\nLocation: Palm Springs\, Cal
 ifornia\, USA. In person: finalists must attend the festival to pitch. US 
 citizens and legal residents only.\nAward: Up to USD 50\,000 in cash prize
 s may be distributed each year among the winning project(s)\; the number o
 f winners and the split are not published. Entry fee USD 60 until 11 Decem
 ber 2026\, then USD 70 until 8 January 2027.\nDuration: Pitches and awards
  during the 16th AmDocs festival\, 17 to 21 March 2027\n\nMore: https://fi
 lmmakers.festhome.com/f/829?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medi
 um=referral
URL:https://filmmakers.festhome.com/f/829?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrant
 desk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Palm Springs\, California\, USA. In person: finalists must attend 
 the festival to pitch. US citizens and legal residents only.
END:VEVENT
